SUMMARY:Ashleworth Adventure
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sarah Fowkes\n\nWe shall meet at 8:30 outside Ashlewort
 h Hub.\nThe run is about 16.5 of trail with a small amount run on lanes. Th
 ere are some muddy parts\, through woods and fields. A little elevation her
 e and there and lots of gates and stiles.\nThis will be a social run\, but 
 you should be able comfortable covering this distance. \nWe should take abo
 ut 3 hours and finish back at the Hub.\nI have asked if they would be able 
 to do bacon sandwiches for us ( I will book in advance if large numbers).\n
 If you click in I’ll create a WhatsApp to finalise any dietary requiremen
 ts etc.\nWe are planning to car share - leaving Malvern at 8am. \nAny quest
 ions Sarah [Phone Number Redacted] (run leader)\n\n\n\nView on Strava: http
 s://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3553837181651649228\n\nSynced 
